:null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_21","text":"Think about everything that's happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_22","text":"When their main squad Matis returned, they had all been corrupted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Chap_12_01","bgArt":"eventscene_chap_12_01","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_23","text":"Missilis was the only no-show during the assault on the underground facility.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Chap_13_01","bgArt":"eventscene_chap_13_01","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_24","text":"It was also revealed recently that Syuen never subjected the members of Matis to a memory wipe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Stage","bgArt":"stage","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["syuen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_25","text":"Then on top of that, one of their researchers became a sort of whistleblower, exposing all sorts of malfeasance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_26","text":"After that, people's faith in the company plummeted, and so did the stock prices.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CityForest_02","bgArt":"cityforest_02","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rapi","neon","anis","rupee","dolla","yan"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_27","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_27","text":"The fact that they didn't go through a memory wipe is an issue?","jump":"d_main_15_04_29","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_28","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_28","text":"So that's what happened.","jump":"d_main_15_04_32","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_29","text":"As it stands, a memory wipe is the only fix for corruption.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_30","text":"Matis not doing that means they're all still inside the Ark, corrupted as ever.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_31","text":"The citizens feel like they're a major liability.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_32","text":"To be honest, Syuen is known for her favoritism towards Matis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_33","text":"I can understand why she would want to preserve their memories.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_34","text":"As a Nikke, part of me hoped she would be able to find another way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_35","text":"But as an investor, it's a different story.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15_04_36","text":"It's complicated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}